    {
      "id": "claim_7ba7c8d07f9444198457064ee38569f2",
      "statement": "The sidecar starts before the server accepts traffic and a start, handshake or protocol failure is fatal with a message naming make sidecar-deps and the V1_HARNESS=go escape hatch, because silently falling back to the Go loop would hide that the requested harness is not running.",
