    },
    {
      "id": "claim_26d5a74becd64682b433b255ec079cc4",
      "statement": "Only one process may own the durable store, so a second sidecar answering on the socket is refused with ErrAlreadyRunning; a short probe window tells an orphan still shutting down apart from another server that owns the socket.",
