    {
      "id": "claim_2b711e5974fa426a8af6adb319375ba0",
      "statement": "spawn builds the child environment in a fresh slice rather than appending to the caller's, and opens a stdin pipe it never writes to: the child exits when that pipe closes, so the sidecar cannot linger with the store open after v1 dies.",
