    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b454bf7cab464be28a1c94ad10f9207f",
      "statement": "watch restarts the sidecar with exponential backoff capped at 30 seconds up to MaxRestarts consecutive attempts, resets the counter when the process had stayed up for RestartHealthyAfter, and gives up after the budget is exhausted.",
