    {
      "id": "claim_42bb46641c51424e8688fe6750157742",
      "statement": "continuationMessage treats a round as unfinished when it has no tool call and either hit the output limit or produced no visible text, returning a prompt that tells the model to answer directly or continue without repeating itself.",
