    {
      "id": "claim_f8de92d40ee04a88b6584d5817e0da3e",
      "statement": "The continuation hook returns {continue: message} from onYield so the turn stays durable across a successor generation, bounded by a process-local counter to three continuations within five minutes because pi-durable's per-task memo resets on continuation.",
