      "id": "claim_a50393921cf743b8b00ad5173737dec6",
      "statement": "When a turn's context is cancelled and it was not already aborted, the loop aborts the run in the sidecar on a fresh timeout and persists the partial output, so a stopped turn does not keep generating into a transcript nobody is watching.",
